sequenceDiagram
autonumber
participant U as unary()
participant D as SSADetector
participant E as scipy.linalg.eigh
U->>D: construct fresh instance
loop each finite value
    U->>D: update(value)
    alt fewer than data_max_size points
        D-->>U: 0.0, ready=false
    else complete disjoint reference/current windows
        opt model absent or refit_interval elapsed
            D->>D: _fit_reference(values before current window)
            D->>D: _choose_lag(centered)
            opt nonzero reference variance
                D->>E: eigh(covariance)
                E-->>D: eigenvalues, eigenvectors
            end
            Note over D: Choose rank and retain reference basis
        end
        D->>D: _evaluate(current window)
        Note over D: Project Hankel rows, RMS residual / reference sigma
        D-->>U: bounded score, result property holds SSAResult
    end
    Note over U: Read instance.ready, store None during warmup
end
